1670
01:31:40,740 --> 01:31:42,340
I was trying to say something nice.

1671
01:31:43,140 --> 01:31:43,460
Eh?

1672
01:31:44,500 --> 01:31:47,180
You mean you have to try that hard to come up with something nice to say?

1673
01:31:48,100 --> 01:31:50,200
