3532
02:52:39,360 --> 02:52:40,900
Here's Monica's writing tip of the day.

3533
02:52:41,820 --> 02:52:46,080
Sometimes when I talk to people who are impressed by my writing, they say things like, I could never do that.

3534
02:52:46,600 --> 02:52:47,920
It's really depressing, you know.

3535
02:52:48,420 --> 02:52:55,020
As someone who loves more than anything else to share the joy of exploring your passions, it pains me when people think that being good just comes naturally.

3536
02:52:55,860 --> 02:52:56,960
That's how it is with everything.

3537
02:52:56,960 --> 02:52:57,720
Not just writing.

3538
02:52:58,960 --> 02:53:01,680
When you try something for the first time, you're probably going to suck at it.

3539
02:53:02,440 --> 02:53:06,220
Sometimes when you finish, you feel really proud of it and even want to share it with everyone.

3540
02:53:06,780 --> 02:53:11,020
Or maybe after a few weeks, you come back to it and you realize it was never really any good.

3541
02:53:11,780 --> 02:53:13,000
That happens to me all the time.

3542
02:53:13,860 --> 02:53:16,660
It can be pretty disheartening to put so much time and effort into something.

3543
02:53:17,540 --> 02:53:19,080
And then realize, it sucks!

3544
02:53:19,780 --> 02:53:23,000
But that tends to happen when you're always comparing yourself to the top professionals.

3545
02:53:24,180 --> 02:53:27,020
When you reach right for the stars, they're always going to be out of your reach.

3546
02:53:27,260 --> 02:53:27,460
You know?

3547
02:53:28,260 --> 02:53:30,720
The truth is, you have to climb up there, step by step.

3548
02:53:31,760 --> 02:53:35,480
And whenever you reach a milestone, first you look back and see how far you've gotten.

3549
02:53:36,220 --> 02:53:38,540
And then you look ahead and realize how much more there is to go.

3550
02:53:39,520 --> 02:53:41,820
So, sometimes it can help to set the bar a little lower.

3551
02:53:42,760 --> 02:53:45,980
Try to find something you think is pretty good, but not world class.

3552
02:53:47,780 --> 02:53:49,340
And you can make your own personal goal.

3553
02:53:50,660 --> 02:53:53,440
It's also really important to understand the scope of what you're trying to do.

3554
02:53:54,400 --> 02:53:58,340
If you jump right into a huge project and you're still amateur, you'll never get it done.

3555
02:53:59,480 --> 02:54:02,160
So if we're talking about writing, a novel might be too much at first.

3556
02:54:02,780 --> 02:54:04,160
Why not try some short stories?

3557
02:54:05,100 --> 02:54:08,980
The great thing about short stories is that you can focus on just one thing that you want to do right.

3558
02:54:10,020 --> 02:54:11,780
That goes for small projects in general.

3559
02:54:12,120 --> 02:54:14,980
You can really focus on the one or two things.

3560
02:54:15,760 --> 02:54:18,300
It's such a good learning experience and stepping stone.

3561
02:54:19,080 --> 02:54:19,880
Oh, one more thing.

3562
02:54:20,480 --> 02:54:23,940
Writing isn't something where you just reach into your heart and something beautiful comes out.

3563
02:54:24,620 --> 02:54:29,620
Just like drawing and painting, it's a skill in itself to learn how to express what you have inside.

3564
02:54:30,360 --> 02:54:32,900
That means there are methods and guides and basics to it.

3565
02:54:33,680 --> 02:54:36,000
Reading up on that stuff can be super eye-opening.

3566
02:54:36,840 --> 02:54:41,560
That sort of planning and organization will really help prevent you from getting overwhelmed and giving up.

3567
