3569
02:54:48,960 --> 02:54:50,160
Nothing comes naturally.

3570
02:54:51,420 --> 02:54:56,260
Our society, our art, everything, it's built on thousands of years of human innovation.

3571
02:54:57,060 --> 02:55:02,840
So as long as you start on that foundation and take it step by step, you too can do amazing things.

3572
02:55:03,640 --> 02:55:04,760
