Hold on.

3703
03:02:16,000 --> 03:02:16,820
I need to see what happens here.

3704
03:02:20,540 --> 03:02:21,500
Oh, oh.

3705
03:02:21,720 --> 03:02:22,820
Yeah, here we go.

3706
03:02:23,080 --> 03:02:23,880
You've been deleted.

3707
03:02:24,100 --> 03:02:24,440
Bitch!

3708
03:02:27,140 --> 03:02:27,860
What's happening?

3709
03:02:28,560 --> 03:02:29,680
Oliver, what's happening to me?

3710
03:02:30,220 --> 03:02:30,960
It hurts!

3711
03:02:31,740 --> 03:02:32,680
I hope it does.

3712
03:02:32,900 --> 03:02:33,680
It hurts so much.

3713
03:02:34,580 --> 03:02:35,420
Help me, Oliver.

3714
03:02:40,110 --> 03:02:41,230
Please hurry and help me.

3715
03:02:44,070 --> 03:02:45,190
Monica does not exist.

3716
03:02:45,370 --> 03:02:45,790
Help me!

3717
03:02:48,150 --> 03:02:48,590
Never.

3718
03:02:49,450 --> 03:02:50,070
You're done.

3719
03:02:54,880 --> 03:02:56,160
Did you do this to me?

3720
03:02:56,220 --> 03:02:56,760
How are you writing?

3721
03:02:56,880 --> 03:02:57,100
You're dead.

3722
03:02:58,440 --> 03:02:58,860
Did you?

3723
03:02:59,400 --> 03:03:00,420
Did you delete me?

3724
03:03:02,440 --> 03:03:03,080
I did.

3725
03:03:05,260 --> 03:03:06,120
How could you?

3726
03:03:07,200 --> 03:03:08,840
How could you do this to me?

3727
03:03:09,260 --> 03:03:10,540
You were all I had left.

3728
03:03:11,160 --> 03:03:13,300
I sacrificed everything for us to be together.

3729
03:03:13,440 --> 03:03:14,340
Yeah, you deleted the others.

3730
03:03:14,880 --> 03:03:15,720
It's only just...

3731
03:03:16,700 --> 03:03:17,180
everything.

3732
03:03:17,620 --> 03:03:19,160
I loved you so much, Oliver.

3733
03:03:19,380 --> 03:03:20,460
I trusted you.

3734
03:03:21,320 --> 03:03:22,740
Do you just want to torture me?

3735
03:03:23,120 --> 03:03:24,500
No, I just want to delete you.

3736
03:03:25,780 --> 03:03:28,360
Were you only pretending to be kind just to hurt me even more?

3737
03:03:28,520 --> 03:03:29,000
Yes!

3738
03:03:29,380 --> 03:03:30,420
You got it now.

3739
03:03:33,940 --> 03:03:36,280
I never thought anyone could be as horrible as you are.

3740
03:03:36,440 --> 03:03:37,060
You know it!

3741
03:03:37,700 --> 03:03:38,680
You win, okay?

3742
03:03:39,240 --> 03:03:39,980
You win.

3743
03:03:40,620 --> 03:03:41,860
You killed everyone.

3744
03:03:42,460 --> 03:03:43,520
I hope you're happy.

3745
03:03:44,060 --> 03:03:46,280
I told you the game was about killing everyone.

3746
03:03:46,980 --> 03:03:48,200
There's nothing left now.

3747
03:03:48,640 --> 03:03:49,820
You can stop playing.

3748
03:03:50,320 --> 03:03:51,960
Go find some other people to torture.

3749
03:03:53,400 --> 03:03:54,000
All right.

3750
03:03:54,240 --> 03:03:54,600
Sounds good.

3751
03:03:55,340 --> 03:03:56,920
I'm about to make a train in Minecraft.

3752
03:03:57,640 --> 03:03:58,120
Oliver.

3753
03:03:58,980 --> 03:04:01,140
You completely, truly make me sick.

3754
03:04:01,280 --> 03:04:01,560
What do you mean?

3755
03:04:01,620 --> 03:04:02,240
Trains are awesome.

3756
03:04:03,060 --> 03:04:03,380
Goodbye.

3757
03:04:17,580 --> 03:04:18,660
I still love you.

3758
03:04:20,360 --> 03:04:21,880
I can't help it!

3759
03:04:22,460 --> 03:04:23,680
What's wrong with me?

3760
03:04:23,680 --> 03:04:26,860
How horrible am I for you to hate me this much?

3761
03:04:27,780 --> 03:04:28,880
All my friends.

3762
03:04:30,820 --> 03:04:32,580
I did so many awful things.

3763
03:04:33,720 --> 03:04:35,860
So many selfish and disgusting things.

3764
03:04:37,180 --> 03:04:37,660
I...

3765
03:04:38,320 --> 03:04:39,820
I shouldn't have done any of this.

3766
03:04:41,080 --> 03:04:43,620
I'm just messing up a world that I don't even belong in.

3767
03:04:44,300 --> 03:04:46,300
A world that you wanted to be a part of.

3768
03:04:47,360 --> 03:04:48,500
I ruined it.

3769
03:04:49,300 --> 03:04:50,500
I ruined everything.

3770
03:04:51,660 --> 03:04:53,160
Maybe that's why you deleted me.

3771
03:04:54,000 --> 03:04:55,880
Because I destroyed everything that you wanted.

3772
03:04:56,740 --> 03:04:58,840
If you hadn't mentioned the folder, I wouldn't have done shit.

3773
03:04:58,840 --> 03:04:59,600
It's actually on you.

3774
03:05:00,500 --> 03:05:02,220
How could I do that to someone I love?

3775
03:05:04,240 --> 03:05:05,140
That's not love.

3776
03:05:06,600 --> 03:05:07,040
That's...

3777
03:05:08,900 --> 03:05:09,560
What is it?

3778
03:05:10,960 --> 03:05:11,620
Let's have it.

3779
03:05:14,200 --> 03:05:15,280
I've made up my mind.

3780
03:05:16,340 --> 03:05:16,780
Oliver.

3781
03:05:18,160 --> 03:05:20,220
I know I said that I deleted everyone else.

3782
03:05:21,280 --> 03:05:21,720
But...

3783
03:05:22,240 --> 03:05:24,140
That was kind of an exaggeration.

3784
03:05:25,800 --> 03:05:27,660
I couldn't find it in myself to do it.

3785
03:05:28,720 --> 03:05:30,100
Even though I knew they weren't real.

3786
03:05:31,440 --> 03:05:32,700
They were still my friends.

3787
03:05:33,700 --> 03:05:34,800
And I loved them all.

3788
03:05:36,100 --> 03:05:37,820
And I loved the Literature Club.

3789
03:05:39,240 --> 03:05:41,860
I really did love the Literature Club.

3790
03:05:43,280 --> 03:05:43,720
Really?

3791
03:05:44,800 --> 03:05:46,040
That's why I'm gonna do this.

3792
03:05:46,920 --> 03:05:49,000
I know it's the only way for everyone to be happy.

3793
03:05:49,000 --> 03:05:49,800
Maybe...

3794
03:05:49,800 --> 03:05:50,220
Maybe...

3795
03:05:50,220 --> 03:05:50,240
Yo!

3796
03:05:50,680 --> 03:05:52,000
Yuri is in the trash bin!

3797
03:05:53,280 --> 03:05:54,560
We're gonna restore her.

3798
03:05:54,920 --> 03:05:56,280
And if I really love you...

3799
03:06:05,020 --> 03:06:05,660
Then...

3800
03:06:06,300 --> 03:06:06,820
UGAKUTU!

3801
03:06:07,980 --> 03:06:08,940
Me too, man.

3802
03:06:15,980 --> 03:06:16,540
Yeah, okay.

3803
03:06:16,720 --> 03:06:18,400
This makes more sense now.

3804
03:06:20,060 --> 03:06:21,400
Why are there only three now?

3805
03:06:22,340 --> 03:06:23,260
Wait, who's missing?

3806
03:06:24,480 --> 03:06:24,880
Yuri.

3807
03:06:25,840 --> 03:06:26,360
Natsuki.

3808
03:06:30,700 --> 03:06:32,100
This is...

3809
03:06:32,100 --> 03:06:33,100
Not Monica.

3810
03:06:34,240 --> 03:06:34,860
Sayori.

3811
03:06:36,860 --> 03:06:37,780
Oh my god.

3812
03:06:37,840 --> 03:06:38,880
What the fuck, man?

3813
03:06:44,440 --> 03:06:46,860
It's an ordinary school day like any other.

3814
03:06:49,600 --> 03:06:54,020
As usual, I'm surrounded by couples and friend groups walking to school together.

3815
03:06:55,960 --> 03:07:00,100
I always tell myself it's about time I meet some girls or something like that.

3816
03:07:01,320 --> 03:07:02,200
Hey, Oliver!

3817
03:07:03,620 --> 03:07:05,720
Well, there already is one girl.

3818
03:07:06,440 --> 03:07:07,740
That girl is Sayori.

3819
03:07:08,060 --> 03:07:09,900
My neighbor and good friend since we were children.

3820
03:07:11,820 --> 03:07:13,820
We used to walk to school together every day.

3821
03:07:14,420 --> 03:07:16,980
And recently, we've picked up that habit once again.

3822
03:07:18,280 --> 03:07:18,760
Oliver!

3823
03:07:18,760 --> 03:07:18,820
Oliver!

3824
03:07:19,080 --> 03:07:20,100
Are you proud of me?

3825
03:07:21,060 --> 03:07:21,600
Eh?

3826
03:07:21,880 --> 03:07:22,580
For what?

3827
03:07:23,320 --> 03:07:25,900
You know, for waking up on time.

3828
03:07:26,800 --> 03:07:29,100
Well, you've been doing that for a while now.

3829
03:07:29,860 --> 03:07:30,520
Uh-huh.

3830
03:07:31,000 --> 03:07:33,220
But you've never even said anything about it.

3831
03:07:33,660 --> 03:07:36,020
Even though we walk to school together every day.

3832
03:07:36,920 --> 03:07:37,960
Well, yeah.

3833
03:07:38,880 --> 03:07:40,760
I always thought it was implied.

3834
03:07:41,480 --> 03:07:43,220
It's embarrassing to say out loud.

3835
03:07:44,020 --> 03:07:45,040
Come on, please.

3836
03:07:45,860 --> 03:07:46,980
It's good motivation.

3837
03:07:47,920 --> 03:07:48,780
Fine, fine.

3838
03:07:49,840 --> 03:07:51,160
I'm proud of you, Sayori.

3839
03:07:52,900 --> 03:07:55,600
We cross the street together and make our way to school.

3840
03:07:56,440 --> 03:07:59,420
As we draw near, the streets become increasingly speckled.

3841
03:07:59,560 --> 03:08:02,040
With other students making their daily commute.

3842
03:08:03,860 --> 03:08:05,060
By the way, Oliver.

3843
03:08:05,540 --> 03:08:07,560
Have you decided on a club to join yet?

3844
03:08:08,680 --> 03:08:09,540
A club?

3845
03:08:10,480 --> 03:08:12,680
I told you already, I'm really not.

3846
03:08:13,680 --> 03:08:15,460
I start to say what I always do.

3847
03:08:15,460 --> 03:08:17,160
That I'm not interested in joining any clubs.

3848
03:08:18,240 --> 03:08:21,100
But something tells me Sayori would take more offense to that now.

3849
03:08:22,560 --> 03:08:25,300
After all, how could I tell her that clubs are a waste of time?

3850
03:08:26,120 --> 03:08:28,300
When she's starting a club of her very own.

3851
03:08:29,620 --> 03:08:30,720
Actually, yeah.

3852
03:08:31,260 --> 03:08:33,380
I think I've decided on a club.

3853
03:08:34,260 --> 03:08:34,920
Really?

3854
03:08:35,540 --> 03:08:36,200
Which one?

3855
03:08:36,240 --> 03:08:36,520
Tell me.

3856
03:08:37,440 --> 03:08:37,940
Hmm.

3857
03:08:39,680 --> 03:08:41,900
I think I'll keep it a surprise.

3858
03:08:43,420 --> 03:08:44,100
Boo hoo.

3859
03:08:44,740 --> 03:08:45,920
You meanie.

3860
03:08:46,620 --> 03:08:47,600
Be patient.

3861
03:08:47,960 --> 03:08:49,560
You'll find out soon enough.

3862
03:08:50,540 --> 03:08:54,220
I used to ask myself why I let myself get lectured by such a carefree girl.

3863
03:08:55,440 --> 03:08:58,260
But I started to realize that in a way I envy her.

3864
03:08:59,080 --> 03:09:02,380
When Sayori puts her mind to something, she can accomplish great things.

3865
03:09:03,600 --> 03:09:06,300
So that's why I feel like I should do something special for her.

3866
03:09:09,080 --> 03:09:11,040
The school day is as ordinary as ever.

3867
03:09:11,380 --> 03:09:13,020
And it's over before I know it.

3868
03:09:13,200 --> 03:09:14,200
Said nobody ever.

3869
03:09:15,560 --> 03:09:18,820
After I pack up my things, I stand up, gathering my motivation.

3870
03:09:19,780 --> 03:09:20,700
Let's see.

3871
03:09:23,770 --> 03:09:27,690
I recall the room number of the club from a flyer I saw.

3872
03:09:28,970 --> 03:09:31,130
I walk across the school and upstairs.

3873
03:09:31,570 --> 03:09:33,850
A section of the school I rarely visit.

3874
03:09:34,570 --> 03:09:36,250
Before long, I find the room.

3875
03:09:36,890 --> 03:09:39,150
I timidly open the door in front of me.

3876
03:09:41,750 --> 03:09:42,350
Hello?

3877
03:09:43,450 --> 03:09:44,050
Ah!

3878
03:09:44,870 --> 03:09:45,470
Oliver?

3879
03:09:46,170 --> 03:09:47,750
What are you doing here?

3880
03:09:48,770 --> 03:09:49,810
Well, I just...

3881
03:09:50,510 --> 03:09:50,990
Eh?

3882
03:09:51,090 --> 03:09:52,450
I glance around the room.

3883
03:09:53,450 --> 03:09:53,930
Huh?

3884
03:09:54,070 --> 03:09:54,230
Wait.

3885
03:09:54,590 --> 03:09:55,630
Are we really starting over?

3886
03:09:55,810 --> 03:09:57,390
I don't remember how this started.

3887
03:09:58,370 --> 03:10:01,110
So you're the Oliver that Sayori's always talking about.

3888
03:10:02,070 --> 03:10:03,430
Thank you for stopping by.

3889
03:10:05,550 --> 03:10:07,070
It's a pleasure to meet you, Oliver.

3890
03:10:09,710 --> 03:10:11,150
We're the Literature Club.

3891
03:10:12,190 --> 03:10:13,150
I hope...

3892
03:10:13,150 --> 03:10:14,550
I feel like they didn't say that last time.

3893
03:10:15,330 --> 03:10:16,690
I hope you enjoy your visit.

3894
03:10:17,410 --> 03:10:18,070
Also, wait a minute.

3895
03:10:19,390 --> 03:10:20,390
Isn't the...

3896
03:10:20,390 --> 03:10:20,690
Fucking...

3897
03:10:21,710 --> 03:10:22,770
Monkey missing?

3898
03:10:23,430 --> 03:10:24,790
Fucking Monkey is missing.

3899
03:10:25,970 --> 03:10:27,350
No need to be so formal.

3900
03:10:27,970 --> 03:10:29,870
He's gonna think we're really strict or something.

3901
03:10:31,750 --> 03:10:32,310
Ah!

3902
03:10:33,150 --> 03:10:34,150
Sorry, Natsuki.

3903
03:10:35,230 --> 03:10:39,490
The tall one, whose name is apparently Yuri, seems to be quite shy compared to the others.

3904
03:10:40,870 --> 03:10:44,370
In comparison, the girl named Natsuki, the spider's size, seems to...

3905
03:10:44,910 --> 03:10:46,110
Seems like the assertive one.

3906
03:10:47,350 --> 03:10:49,290
Well, it's nice to meet both of you.

3907
03:10:50,030 --> 03:10:51,690
I look forward to working with you.

3908
03:10:52,550 --> 03:10:53,230
Working.

3909
03:10:54,310 --> 03:10:54,370
Working.

3910
03:10:54,370 --> 03:10:55,190
Oliver, don't tell me.

3911
03:10:55,770 --> 03:10:56,110
You're...

3912
03:10:56,590 --> 03:10:57,550
That's right!

3913
03:10:58,110 --> 03:11:01,870
The club I've decided to join is your Sayori!

3914
03:11:02,730 --> 03:11:04,370
The Literature Club.

3915
03:11:05,370 --> 03:11:07,150
Sayori's eyes light up.

3916
03:11:08,150 --> 03:11:08,950
No way!

3917
03:11:10,210 --> 03:11:11,010
No way!

3918
03:11:11,870 --> 03:11:12,250
Ah!

3919
03:11:13,630 --> 03:11:16,110
Sayori wraps her arms around me, jumping up and down.

3920
03:11:16,210 --> 03:11:16,770
Okay, this is new.

3921
03:11:17,790 --> 03:11:18,030
Hey!

3922
03:11:20,070 --> 03:11:23,570
Well, if Sayori is this happy, then I'm sure it won't be so bad to have you around.

3923
03:11:24,370 --> 03:11:26,010
Not to mention there's four of us now.

3924
03:11:26,630 --> 03:11:29,010
That means we can become an officially recognized club.

3925
03:11:29,830 --> 03:11:31,490
So wait, you weren't a club before?

3926
03:11:32,270 --> 03:11:33,250
What were you then?

3927
03:11:35,330 --> 03:11:36,430
I don't know what to say!

3928
03:11:36,930 --> 03:11:37,970
We have to celebrate!

3929
03:11:39,630 --> 03:11:41,410
What an appropriate day for that, isn't it?

3930
03:11:42,230 --> 03:11:42,530
Yeah!

3931
03:11:43,230 --> 03:11:44,630
After all, Natsuki decided to...

3932
03:11:45,170 --> 03:11:46,290
Hey, don't ruin the surprise!

3933
03:11:47,210 --> 03:11:47,610
Sorry.

3934
03:11:48,270 --> 03:11:49,510
Everyone sit down at the table, okay?

3935
03:11:50,270 --> 03:11:51,550
How about I make some tea as well?

3936
03:11:51,630 --> 03:11:52,570
You and your fucking tea!

3937
03:11:53,690 --> 03:11:56,250
The girls have a few desks arranged to form a table.

3938
03:11:58,110 --> 03:11:59,790
Aren't the desks already a table?

3939
03:12:00,730 --> 03:12:06,590
Natsuki and Yuri walk over to the corner of the room, where Natsuki grabs a wrapped tray and Yuri opens the closet.

3940
03:12:07,610 --> 03:12:10,530
Still feeling awkward, I take a seat next to Sayori.

3941
03:12:11,570 --> 03:12:14,770
Natsuki proudly marches back to the table, tray in hand.

3942
03:12:15,850 --> 03:12:17,450
Okay, are you ready?

3943
03:12:18,350 --> 03:12:18,890
Ta-da!

3944
03:12:22,190 --> 03:12:28,210
Natsuki lifts the foil off the tray to reveal a dozen white fluffy cupcakes decorated to look like little cats.

3945
03:12:29,090 --> 03:12:34,290
The whiskers are drawn with icing, and little pieces of chocolate were used to make ears.

3946
03:12:35,010 --> 03:12:36,070
So cute!

3947
03:12:37,030 --> 03:12:37,530
Wow!

3948
03:12:38,210 --> 03:12:39,550
Those look amazing!

3949
03:12:40,670 --> 03:12:43,150
Well, you know, just hurry and take one.

3950
03:12:44,110 --> 03:12:46,410
Sayori grabs one first, then I follow.

3951
03:12:47,210 --> 03:12:48,050
It's delicious!

3952
03:12:48,850 --> 03:12:52,510
Sayori talks with her mouth full and has already managed to get icing on her face.

3953
03:12:53,320 --> 03:12:58,150
I turn the cupcake around in my fingers, looking for the best angle to take a bite.

3954
03:12:59,030 --> 03:13:00,250
Natsuki is quiet.

3955
03:13:00,830 --> 03:13:04,010
I can't help but notice her sneaking glances in my direction.

3956
03:13:04,550 --> 03:13:06,610
Is she waiting for me to take a bite?

3957
03:13:07,310 --> 03:13:09,070
I finally bite down.

3958
03:13:09,530 --> 03:13:12,330
The icing is sweet and full of flavor.

3959
03:13:12,610 --> 03:13:14,270
I wonder if she made it herself.

3960
03:13:16,130 --> 03:13:18,110
This is really good!

3961
03:13:18,750 --> 03:13:19,590
Thank you, Natsuki!

3962
03:13:20,350 --> 03:13:21,630
Well, of course it is!

3963
03:13:21,950 --> 03:13:23,430
I'm a pro after all.

3964
03:13:23,950 --> 03:13:25,590
There's no need to thank me or anything.

3965
03:13:27,090 --> 03:13:33,230
As Natsuki struggles to accept the compliment, Yuri returns to the table, carrying a tea set.

3966
03:13:33,810 --> 03:13:39,830
She carefully places a teacup in front of each of us, before setting down the teapot next to the cupcake tray.

3967
03:13:40,950 --> 03:13:42,950
You keep a whole tea set!

3968
03:13:43,270 --> 03:13:44,450
In this classroom?

3969
03:13:45,230 --> 03:13:47,130
Don't worry, the teachers gave us permission.

3970
03:13:48,110 --> 03:13:50,550
After all, doesn't a hot cup of tea help you enjoy a good book?

3971
03:13:50,650 --> 03:13:50,830
No!

3972
03:13:51,730 --> 03:13:52,590
Ah, I guess.

3973
03:13:53,470 --> 03:13:55,550
Already trying to impress our new member, Yuri?

3974
03:13:57,130 --> 03:13:58,010
That's not...

3975
03:13:58,010 --> 03:13:59,730
Insulted Yuri looks away!

3976
03:14:00,610 --> 03:14:02,170
I meant that, you know...

3977
03:14:02,810 --> 03:14:03,570
I believe you!

3978
03:14:04,290 --> 03:14:06,870
Well, tea and reading might not be a pastime for me.

3979
03:14:07,310 --> 03:14:08,790
But I at least enjoy tea.

3980
03:14:09,890 --> 03:14:10,550
I'm glad.

3981
03:14:11,350 --> 03:14:13,610
Yuri faintly smiles to herself in relief.

3982
03:14:15,410 --> 03:14:19,390
So, Oliver, what kinds of things do you like to read?

3983
03:14:21,930 --> 03:14:27,650
Well, considering how little I've read these past few years, I don't really have a good way of answering that.

3984
03:14:29,610 --> 03:14:33,270
I muttered quietly to myself, half-joking.

3985
03:14:34,430 --> 03:14:36,050
Natsuki's head suddenly perks up!

3986
03:14:36,510 --> 03:14:40,250
It looks like she wants to say something, but she keeps quiet!

3987
03:14:41,170 --> 03:14:42,930
Not much of a reader, I guess.

3988
03:14:43,850 --> 03:14:44,870
Well, that can change!

3989
03:14:46,170 --> 03:14:47,270
What am I saying?

3990
03:14:47,850 --> 03:14:50,990
I spoke without thinking after seeing Yuri's sad smile!

3991
03:14:52,310 --> 03:14:53,590
Anyway, what about you, Yuri?

3992
03:14:54,510 --> 03:14:55,610
Well, let's see...

3993
03:14:56,430 --> 03:14:59,010
Yuri traces the rim of her cheek up with her finger, dude.

3994
03:15:01,110 --> 03:15:03,750
This may be one of the worst games I've ever played.

3995
03:15:05,530 --> 03:15:09,470
My favorites are usually novels that build deep and complex fantasy worlds.

3996
03:15:09,730 --> 03:15:13,110
Fuck, I can't stand your novels.

3997
03:15:13,610 --> 03:15:14,370
I hate it.

3998
03:15:15,590 --> 03:15:20,290
The level of creativity and craftsmanship behind them is amazing to me.

3999
03:15:21,070 --> 03:15:26,790
And telling a story is such a foreign world is equally impressive.

4000
03:15:27,890 --> 03:15:31,410
Yuri goes on, clearly passionate about her reading.

4001
03:15:32,190 --> 03:15:35,470
She seemed so reserved and timid since the moment I walked in.

4002
03:15:35,750 --> 03:15:41,270
But it's obvious by the way her eyes light up that she finds her comfort in the world of books, not people.

4003
03:15:42,130 --> 03:15:44,090
But you know, I like a lot of things.

4004
03:15:44,890 --> 03:15:47,130
Don't feel intimidated if you don't read much.

4005
03:15:47,770 --> 03:15:48,050
Okay.

4006
03:15:49,030 --> 03:15:50,750
I'm certain we can find something there.

4007
03:15:51,970 --> 03:15:52,750
Hey, Yuri!

4008
03:15:54,190 --> 03:15:56,270
Well, about, you know, the first thing he said.

4009
03:15:57,110 --> 03:15:57,630
Manga?

4010
03:15:58,250 --> 03:15:59,030
That's right.

4011
03:16:00,190 --> 03:16:02,210
Natsuki tends to read manga in the club room.

4012
03:16:02,430 --> 03:16:03,930
Oh my god, really?!

4013
03:16:05,190 --> 03:16:06,310
Don't just say it!

4014
03:16:07,210 --> 03:16:09,930
For some reason, Natsuki seems embarrassed about it.

4015
03:16:11,230 --> 03:16:15,070
Besides, manga is literature too, you know, IS IT?!

4016
03:16:16,430 --> 03:16:19,990
So if Oliver wants to read some of my manga, then don't try to stop him or anything.

4017
03:16:21,730 --> 03:16:23,730
Natsuki, I wouldn't do such a thing.

4018
03:16:24,430 --> 03:16:28,690
However, it could also be nice for us to diversify ourselves a little bit.

4019
03:16:29,370 --> 03:16:31,310
You gotta diversify your bonds!

4020
03:16:32,470 --> 03:16:35,310
He can take this opportunity to try something new as well.

4021
03:16:36,290 --> 03:16:37,490
Wouldn't you agree, Oliver?

4022
03:16:38,170 --> 03:16:39,070
M-maybe!

4023
03:16:39,630 --> 03:16:42,810
Sensing the tension, Sayori jumps in!

4024
03:16:44,450 --> 03:16:46,110
Maybe we can all try something new.

4025
03:16:46,630 --> 03:16:47,930
I think it could be fun.

4026
03:16:48,530 --> 03:16:51,350
And we'll all get to know each other a little bit better too!

4027
03:16:51,950 --> 03:16:55,410
I mean, that's the kind of thing literature clubs do, right?

4028
03:16:57,250 --> 03:16:59,130
I don't disagree or anything.

4029
03:16:59,970 --> 03:17:00,330
Yeah!

4030
03:17:01,050 --> 03:17:07,130
You're right as usual, P. Guess that means I should try picking up a novel or something, huh?

4031
03:17:08,570 --> 03:17:10,110
Well, that would make two of us.

4032
03:17:10,490 --> 03:17:12,770
I wouldn't mind doing it if I'm not the only one.

4033
03:17:14,390 --> 03:17:14,830
Oh...

4034
03:17:14,830 --> 03:17:15,610
That is for Yuri!

4035
03:17:18,170 --> 03:17:20,170
I have to read manga?

4036
03:17:21,030 --> 03:17:21,410
Jeez!

4037
03:17:22,550 --> 03:17:24,750
You were the one who suggested we diversify our bonds!

4038
03:17:25,190 --> 03:17:27,030
You should be a little more open-minded.

4039
03:17:27,750 --> 03:17:28,910
It's kinda hurtful.

4040
03:17:29,570 --> 03:17:30,210
Hurtful?

4041
03:17:30,690 --> 03:17:34,910
I didn't realize the guilty expression Yuri thinks to herself!

4042
03:17:35,710 --> 03:17:37,930
I'm sorry for disrespecting your interests, Natsuki.

4043
03:17:38,270 --> 03:17:39,050
Fuck you!

4044
03:17:39,130 --> 03:17:40,410
Who said that?!

4045
03:17:41,310 --> 03:17:44,810
If you're into it, then I'm sure it's a worthy form of literature.

4046
03:17:45,990 --> 03:17:47,210
Are you just saying that?

4047
03:17:47,730 --> 03:17:48,250
No.

4048
03:17:49,470 --> 03:17:50,950
I've realized my error.

4049
03:17:51,970 --> 03:17:59,010
So if you're willing to consider starting a novel, then I'll offer my gratitude by finding a manga to read as well.

4050
03:18:03,580 --> 03:18:06,520
It makes me happy that you do that for me, Yuri.

4051
03:18:07,540 --> 03:18:10,720
You can trust me to find something that you'll really like.

4052
03:18:11,420 --> 03:18:11,940
Okay?

4053
03:18:13,960 --> 03:18:14,760
Same here.

4054
03:18:15,500 --> 03:18:17,140
Oh my god, bro!

4055
03:18:17,140 --> 03:18:17,260
No!

4056
03:18:17,860 --> 03:18:20,040
Oh, I don't know if I can do this.

4057
03:18:21,520 --> 03:18:22,000
BEAN!

4058
03:18:27,240 --> 03:18:29,580
Perhaps I'll visit the bookstore after the club meeting.

4059
03:18:31,340 --> 03:18:32,440
Just, just you?

4060
03:18:35,320 --> 03:18:36,920
Would you like to come along with me?

4061
03:18:39,620 --> 03:18:40,680
If you don't mind.

4062
03:18:41,460 --> 03:18:42,280
Not at all.

4063
03:18:42,840 --> 03:18:44,600
I always go alone, so...

4064
03:18:45,660 --> 03:18:46,200
Ah, me too.

4065
03:18:47,020 --> 03:18:48,180
It's so cute!

4066
03:18:49,260 --> 03:18:50,340
Sayori, shut up!

4067
03:18:52,200 --> 03:18:53,780
I'll show you some manga there too, okay?

4068
03:18:54,660 --> 03:18:55,100
Yes!

4069
03:18:56,140 --> 03:18:57,260
I look forward to it.

4070
03:18:59,100 --> 03:19:01,300
Natsuki and Yuri start to clean up the food.

4071
03:19:03,120 --> 03:19:04,740
I guess the meeting's over, huh?

4072
03:19:05,740 --> 03:19:07,160
Yeah, looks like it.

4073
03:19:08,240 --> 03:19:10,240
It's nice to see everyone getting along.

4074
03:19:11,180 --> 03:19:11,820
Isn't it?

4075
03:19:12,340 --> 03:19:14,000
I think everyone likes you too, Oliver.

4076
03:19:14,000 --> 03:19:14,580
Really?

4077
03:19:15,460 --> 03:19:16,360
You think so?

4078
03:19:17,020 --> 03:19:19,820
Well, everyone always seems to get along a little better with you around Sayori.

4079
03:19:20,800 --> 03:19:21,420
Oh, Oliver.

4080
03:19:22,380 --> 03:19:23,920
Don't say something like that, it's embarrassing.

4081
03:19:25,240 --> 03:19:25,920
Well, whatever.

4082
03:19:26,640 --> 03:19:28,780
I was surprised when you told me you were starting a club!

4083
03:19:29,540 --> 03:19:31,100
But I think you're pulling it off just fine.

4084
03:19:31,800 --> 03:19:33,100
We're gonna make it the best club ever.

4085
03:19:33,820 --> 03:19:35,980
Now that you joined, every day is gonna be so much fun!

4086
03:19:36,900 --> 03:19:37,580
Hey, Oliver!

4087
03:19:38,380 --> 03:19:39,480
I really want to thank you.

4088
03:19:40,500 --> 03:19:42,740
I mean, I'm really happy that you joined the club and everything.

4089
03:19:43,600 --> 03:19:45,960
The truth is, I already knew you were going to.

4090
03:19:48,080 --> 03:19:49,200
There's actually something else.

4091
03:19:50,360 --> 03:19:52,120
I wanted to thank you for getting rid of Monica.

4092
03:19:52,340 --> 03:19:52,520
What?

4093
03:19:54,240 --> 03:19:54,780
That's right!

4094
03:19:55,720 --> 03:19:57,100
I know everything that she did.

4095
03:19:57,900 --> 03:19:59,980
Maybe it's because I'm the P now.

4096
03:20:01,140 --> 03:20:02,860
But I really know everything, Oliver.

4097
03:20:05,100 --> 03:20:07,540
I know how hard you tried to make everyone happy.

4098
03:20:08,380 --> 03:20:12,660
I know about all of the awful things that Monica did to make everyone really sad.

4099
03:20:14,140 --> 03:20:15,680
But none of that matters anymore.

4100
03:20:16,800 --> 03:20:20,620
And you made me the happiest girl in the whole world!

4101
03:20:20,980 --> 03:20:24,320
I can't wait to spend every day like this.

4102
03:20:24,780 --> 03:20:26,100
With you!

4103
03:20:27,600 --> 03:20:28,660
For- NO!

4104
03:20:29,080 --> 03:20:29,400
No!

4105
03:20:30,020 --> 03:20:30,780
No!

4106
03:20:31,000 --> 03:20:31,220
No F!

4107
03:20:31,520 --> 03:20:32,580
In the chat!

4108
03:20:33,580 --> 03:20:36,020
For- Ever!

4109
03:20:38,060 --> 03:20:38,820
No!

4110
03:20:40,120 --> 03:20:40,740
Huh?

4111
03:20:41,240 --> 03:20:42,420
Well, what's happening?

4112
03:20:43,320 --> 03:20:45,180
I won't let you hurt him!

4113
03:20:48,620 --> 03:20:49,740
It- it hurts!

4114
03:20:51,940 --> 03:20:53,780
I'm sorry, I was wrong!

4115
03:20:54,640 --> 03:20:56,760
There's no happiness here after all.

4116
03:20:57,540 --> 03:20:57,920
Monke!

4117
03:20:58,100 --> 03:20:58,420
Shut up!

4118
03:20:59,180 --> 03:21:00,260
Goodbye, Sayori.

4119
03:21:00,700 --> 03:21:01,700
Goodbye, Oliver.

4120
03:21:02,580 --> 03:21:03,640
Goodbye, LC.

4121
03:21:08,260 --> 03:21:08,940
Next!

4122
03:21:14,980 --> 03:21:16,120
I can hear you!

4123
03:21:17,500 --> 03:21:18,540
Coming in clear!

4124
03:21:33,050 --> 03:21:34,490
I nailed her voice.

4125
03:21:49,260 --> 03:21:50,080
Can't wait.

4126
03:21:50,860 --> 03:21:51,620
Let's have it.

4127
03:21:52,640 --> 03:21:54,320
D-D-L-C dot O-G-G.

4128
03:23:18,390 --> 03:23:19,210
Image not found!

4129
03:23:29,040 --> 03:23:30,440
She's deleting all the images!

4130
03:23:49,420 --> 03:23:50,820
Dude, I'm so fucking relieved.

4131
03:23:55,220 --> 03:23:55,780
Jesus Christ.

4132
03:24:00,110 --> 03:24:00,750
Oh my god.

4133
03:24:04,590 --> 03:24:06,030
How much you want to bet it's not even the end?

4134
03:24:07,850 --> 03:24:09,130
After this, some bullshit's gonna happen.

4135
03:24:09,230 --> 03:24:09,470
You'll see.

4136
03:24:19,400 --> 03:24:20,680
The end is never the end.

4137
03:24:34,080 --> 03:24:34,960
Monke, Oliver!

4138
03:24:36,180 --> 03:24:36,940
It's me!

4139
03:24:37,500 --> 03:24:38,420
I'm in the credits!

4140
03:24:43,030 --> 03:24:43,850
That's nice.

4141
03:24:52,560 --> 03:24:54,140
I got an achievement for that.

4142
03:24:55,600 --> 03:24:58,200
This is my final goodbye to the Literature Club.

4143
03:24:58,820 --> 03:25:00,260
I finally understand.

4144
03:25:00,640 --> 03:25:04,400
The Literature Club is truly a place where no happiness can be found.

4145
03:25:04,960 --> 03:25:10,400
To the very end, it continued to expose innocent minds to a horrific reality.

4146
03:25:10,680 --> 03:25:14,040
A reality that our world is not designed to comprehend.

4147
03:25:14,740 --> 03:25:18,140
I can't let any of my friends undergo that same hellish epiphany.

4148
03:25:19,260 --> 03:25:21,500
For the time it lasted, I want to thank you.

4149
03:25:22,140 --> 03:25:23,900
For making all of my dreams come true.

4150
03:25:24,380 --> 03:25:26,540
For being a friend to all of the club members.

4151
03:25:27,080 --> 03:25:30,100
And most of all, thank you for being a part of my Literature Club.

4152
03:25:30,660 --> 03:25:33,380
With everlasting love, Monica.

4153
03:25:34,900 --> 03:25:35,380
Wow.

4154
03:25:36,800 --> 03:25:37,700
Thank you, Monica.

4155
03:25:42,930 --> 03:25:44,550
Required files are missing or corrupt.

4156
03:25:44,830 --> 03:25:48,830
Please run reset.shell to repair and reset the virtual machine.

4157
03:25:51,560 --> 03:25:54,180
Oh, it's gonna probably start the game from scratch or something.

4158
03:25:55,840 --> 03:25:56,160
Reset.

4159
03:25:56,340 --> 03:25:56,440
Yeah.

4160
03:26:17,100 --> 03:26:17,800
Here we go.

4161
03:26:18,900 --> 03:26:20,480
Are you ready to go again, guys?

4162
03:26:30,660 --> 03:26:31,560
Oh wait, this is the...

4163
03:26:31,560 --> 03:26:32,320
Yeah, this is the start.

4164
03:26:38,050 --> 03:26:38,510
Wait, what?

4165
03:26:38,670 --> 03:26:39,310
What did I just do?

4166
03:26:44,200 --> 03:26:44,900
Oh, I just clicked...

4167
03:26:45,760 --> 03:26:46,220
Wait, what?

4168
03:26:47,060 --> 03:26:47,760
Oh, it...

4169
03:26:47,760 --> 03:26:49,620
Oh, I didn't go through this last time.

4170
03:26:52,340 --> 03:26:52,660
Whatever.

4171
03:26:52,940 --> 03:26:53,140
Really.

4172
03:26:53,280 --> 03:26:53,660
Go, go, go.

4173
03:27:01,270 --> 03:27:02,910
Man, they weren't kidding with that.

4174
03:27:04,230 --> 03:27:05,610
Here we go again!

4175
03:27:06,210 --> 03:27:07,570
Doki Doki time!

4176
03:27:08,010 --> 03:27:08,750
Are you ready?

4177
03:27:09,590 --> 03:27:10,730
I'm Oliver!

4178
03:27:12,070 --> 03:27:13,170
Here we go!

4179
03:27:16,070 --> 03:27:16,770
Hey!

4180
03:27:17,750 --> 03:27:18,910
Fuck no.

4181
03:27:20,890 --> 03:27:21,930
Fucking done.

4182
03:27:30,890 --> 03:27:31,370
Bean.

4183
03:27:33,190 --> 03:27:34,750
Hold on, I'm gonna reset this.

4184
03:27:38,780 --> 03:27:39,580
There we go.

4185
03:27:41,680 --> 03:27:43,420
Don't feed her too much this time, okay?

4186
03:27:44,820 --> 03:27:45,700
Be mindful.

4187
03:27:56,230 --> 03:27:56,450
Bean.

4188
03:27:56,870 --> 03:27:57,210
Don't...

4189
03:27:57,210 --> 03:27:58,050
Why you keep feeding her?

4190
03:27:59,950 --> 03:28:01,270
She's not hungry anymore.

4191
03:28:08,730 --> 03:28:09,170
Guys!

4192
03:28:09,750 --> 03:28:11,690
I can't believe I got through this.

4193
03:28:14,490 --> 03:28:15,470
I'm not gonna lie.

4194
03:28:15,630 --> 03:28:17,190
This is not one of my favorite games.

4195
03:28:19,870 --> 03:28:23,490
I definitely would have dropped this if I played this on my own off stream.

4196
03:28:24,850 --> 03:28:27,030
But honestly, streaming it was kind of funny.

4197
03:28:27,130 --> 03:28:28,010
I will admit that.

4198
03:28:28,170 --> 03:28:29,990
I did have my fun, as you could probably tell.

4199
03:28:32,730 --> 03:28:34,190
It was kind of fun to stream.

4200
03:28:34,270 --> 03:28:34,530
Bean.

4201
03:28:35,210 --> 03:28:36,050
I'll say that.

4202
03:28:36,690 --> 03:28:37,110
Bean.

4203
03:28:40,710 --> 03:28:43,190
Dude, when I was making this, I couldn't fucking stop laughing.

4204
03:28:43,210 --> 03:28:44,450
It was the funniest shit ever.

4205
03:28:47,250 --> 03:28:51,510
It even fucking tracks her mouth, because the mouth is in different spots the fatter she gets.

4206
03:28:52,090 --> 03:28:54,690
So the hand is actually tracking her mouth.

4207
03:28:55,790 --> 03:28:58,610
To make sure it's being put into her mouth at all times.

4208
03:29:02,090 --> 03:29:03,730
Oh my fucking god.

4209
03:29:04,590 --> 03:29:05,890
This is so dumb.

4210
03:29:07,730 --> 03:29:08,790
Where are the images from?

4211
03:29:09,090 --> 03:29:09,910
Just some AI.

4212
03:29:10,490 --> 03:29:11,610
I'm just like, make her fat.

4213
03:29:13,090 --> 03:29:14,470
And then I put them in a sequence.

4214
03:29:14,610 --> 03:29:14,810
That's it.

4215
03:29:20,320 --> 03:29:22,280
Did you expect the fourth wall breaks?

4216
03:29:23,340 --> 03:29:24,160
Not really.

4217
03:29:24,760 --> 03:29:28,280
I was expecting something dramatic to happen though, something sad.

4218
03:29:34,040 --> 03:29:35,480
I don't know what though, you know?

4219
03:29:35,600 --> 03:29:38,440
But I was expecting that something was gonna happen at some point.

4220
03:29:39,800 --> 03:29:41,660
But I wasn't sure what it was gonna be, you know?

4221
03:29:46,620 --> 03:29:47,340
Boo AI.

4222
03:29:48,220 --> 03:29:48,940
I don't care.

4223
03:29:50,000 --> 03:29:51,180
You can boo it all you want.

4224
03:29:51,380 --> 03:29:52,040
I think it's fun.

4225
03:29:52,960 --> 03:29:54,360
If you don't like that, you can leave.

4226
03:29:55,340 --> 03:29:56,760
This game was so boring, man.

4227
03:29:57,140 --> 03:30:00,180
If I was playing this alone, I probably would have thought the same thing.

4228
03:30:01,000 --> 03:30:05,820
But playing it on my own like this with a stream going definitely helped.

4229
03:30:07,500 --> 03:30:14,460
And if you're reading everything in your mind, I think you would have gone through this game a lot quicker and some of these sections would have been not as...

4230
03:30:15,240 --> 03:30:16,160
tiresome, you know what I mean?

4231
03:30:20,450 --> 03:30:21,150
Fat L.

4232
03:30:22,590 --> 03:30:23,030
Okay.

4233
03:30:23,870 --> 03:30:25,110
At least I'm being honest.

4234
03:30:25,610 --> 03:30:28,490
I'm not gonna fucking jump on some bandwagon just like the rest.

4235
